      "comment": "ARCANE LEGEND (1) turned spotting a big start finishing sixth (30.54) last time in a Mix at this track. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. NABIAC CITY (3) bolted in last time, scoring by 2.25 lengths in slick time (23.21) to take a Maiden in a new PB this course and distance. This tougher but looks a leading chance again. FRANKIE'S ANGEL (8) ran a nice race two back to fill a minor placing then got off the mark last time (23.29) at this track over 400m. Will break from a wide draw. Harder here but will be in this for a long way. GOLDILOCKS GORT (2) has ability and can feature with the right run after missing a cheque here most recently.",
